-footprint CAMR containment is unresolved. This is not the material coherent-core curve, a 3-D ring volume, or a claim for August/October. Source JPEG quality, manual axis reading, line thickness, and schematic OSW state geometry limit precision.","source_date":"2018-07-26","source_id":"source:8a85446449036671","source_locator":"Figure 2, 29 May 2013 panel, outermost closed blue instantaneous SSH contour","source_locator_status":"specific","source_snapshot_id":"source:31502c92130baa29","subject_id":"eddy:published:kraken-2013","support_claim_id":null,"target_collection":"named_eddy_footprint_candidates","target_id":"footprint_candidate:kraken:2013-05-29","unit":null,"value":null},{"assertion_status":"recorded_footprint_candidate_not_verified_boundary","evidence_class":"figure_digitized","footprint_support":{"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"boundary_type":"figure_digitized_instantaneous_ssh_contour_proxy","coordinate_reference_status":"Longitude/latitude inferred by linear calibration of source figure axes. Source datum/projection are unspecified; seven-decimal output is display precision only.","entity_id":"eddy:published:ursa-2021","geometry_id":"geometry:0159","geometry_sha256":"618ac89d19fd5f7af1e38069cd580a19dbcfcb91925cee429d6b9899d9a032d0","identity_status":"publication_scoped_event_contour_attribution_unverified","method":"Threshold maximum RGB channel below 40/70/100 within the pinned interior ROI; require one dominant closed hollow loop; trace outer and inner stroke edges using CHAIN_APPROX_SIMPLE (exact collinear source-pixel compression), without morphological repair; preserve rejected non-simple threshold-100 rings; transfer common figure tick calibration; test nominal plus sixteen independent +/-3-pixel anchor shifts per accepted edge/threshold; intersect approximate coast-masked OSW display polygons.","observation_date":"2021-03-07","physical_boundary_admitted":false,"physical_limit":"Dated instantaneous figure-derived SSH contour proxy during the Ursa