ation only. Figure datum is unspecified; crop bounds and contour are approximate. Nominal overlap does not include calibration/segmentation uncertainty and does not identify Kraken or align its observation date with a movie frame.","source_date":"2024-03-25","source_id":"source:d4e82da0872ed45c","source_locator":"NASA picker crop level0_A_1; bounds and movie address in pinned crop ledger","source_locator_status":"specific","source_snapshot_id":"source:354f29686c861726","subject_id":"eddy:published:ursa-2021","support_claim_id":"claim:footprint_candidate:ursa:2021-03-07","target_collection":"footprint_movie_context","target_id":"footprint_movie_context:footprint_candidate:ursa:2021-03-07:level0_A_1","unit":null,"value":null},{"id":"claim:measurement:southern-east-madagascar:reported-extent","subject_id":"current:southern-east-madagascar","object_id":null,"predicate":"reported_length","value":650,"unit":"km","target_collection":"measurements","target_id":"measurement:southern-east-madagascar:reported-extent","source_id":"source:dddb5c5db92e5fe3","source_locator":"Introduction paragraph2","source_locator_status":"specific","evidence_class":"published_estimate","assertion_status":"reported_or_derived_measurement","scope":"Author-reported approximate southern branch extent from about 20°S to Cap Sainte Marie near 25°30′S. Contextual literature estimate citing Duncan (1970) and Lutjeharms (1988b), not a new April 2001 path measurement. Coordinates, reference axis, fixed layer, reference period and error unspecified.","observation_time":null,"review_status":"not_individually_reviewed","reviewer":null,"review_date":null,"review_note":"Internal editorial passage review supports the reported number and branch scope; external scientific review remains pending.","method":"Linked factual extraction from original publisher HTML; no geodesic calculation or figure digitization.","method_source_id":"source:dddb5c5db92e5fe3","method_status":"described","source_date":"2008-08-05","sou