 exact occupation dates of this current band are not separately assigned here."},{"claim_id":"claim:current_source_observation:0007","entity_id":"current:alaska-coastal-gulf","geometry_status":"source_reported_locality_no_digitized_section_geometry","id":"current_source_observation:0007","observation_end":"1989-07-15","observation_event_id":"shelikof-sea-valley-1989-alaska-coastal","observation_start":"1989-05-10","observation_type":"moored_current_meter_transport_section","physical_relation":"local_named_current_observation_only_whole_current_passage_unresolved","reported_locality":"Shelikof Sea Valley, Gulf of Alaska; not the exit-to-Shelikof-Strait mooring line","reported_section_endpoints_lon_lat":null,"source_id":"source:48b84ff7f08f8e6e","source_locator":"Published article, PDF page 4 (printed page 26), Table 1 caption, 10 May-15 July 1989 sea-valley exception; PDF page 5 (printed page 27), section 2.2, mooring-array location in 1989; section 3.3 describes the coastal-current transport context. Published PDF: https://workspace.aoos.org/files/2656915/Stabeno_etal_2016_Longterm_Obs_ACC.pdf","source_snapshot_id":"source:2e1077cf29d52f00","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.dsr2.2015.12.016","spatial_basis":"The paper identifies mooring arrays in Shelikof Sea Valley for the 1989 transport calculation. This is published local coastal-current evidence; no array endpoints, station coordinates, observed current axis, or footprint are digitized here.","state_assignment_method":"source_reported_gulf_of_alaska_shelikof_locality_to_osw_alsk_semantic_state","state_boundary_limit":"ALSK is assigned by the source-reported northern Gulf of Alaska locality. This is a semantic regional association, not an observed-geometry intersection with the approximate OSW polygon; no BERS association follows from this observation.","state_id":"state:ALSK","time_detail":"Published Table 1 caption explicitly identifies 10 May-15 July 1989 as a sea-valley transport interval. The dates del