t"},"section_orientation":"Meridional section; not reinterpreted as exact flow-normal span.","layer":"Eastward thermocline/intermediate flow reaching neutral density 27.975 kg/m3 (about 2000 m); not 110 km at every depth.","time_convention":"26 October-1 November 2009 station occupation within ORCA cruise 15 October-11 November 2009; single survey, not autumn climatology.","boundary_rule":"Source-delimited current domain between 33.5 and 34.5 N based on hydrography and velocity/transport analysis. No universal velocity threshold assumed.","source_url":"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2011JC007129","source_citation":"Comas-Rodriguez et al. (2011), The Azores Current System from a meridional section at 24.5 W, Journal of Geophysical Research: Oceans, doi:10.1029/2011JC007129.","source_locator":"Abstract [1], Data and Methods [6], current domains [12] and Discussion [15].","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-03","source_evidence_kind":"published_hydrographic_velocity_section","extraction_method":"Reported 110 km span transcribed; section limits recorded from prose. No source figure digitized or inferred axis width calculated.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"remaining_gates":["Review section boundary, vertical support and figure-caption date discrepancy.","Obtain repeated seasonal sections before annual variability or representative width.","Canonical measurement admission and release review."],"phase_label":"26 Oct–1 Nov 2009 section","source_quality_note":"Figure 1 caption says fall 2010, whereas abstract/data text specifies 2009 and detailed station occupation 26 Oct-1 Nov 2009. Follow explicit data text and retain discrepancy pending review.","phase_kind":"dated_section","observed_period":{"start":"2009-10-26","end":"2009-11-01"}},{"id":"azores-countercurrent-2009-section-width","current_id":"azores-countercurrent","name":"Azores Countercurrent","status":"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical","measurement