 before annual variability or representative width.","Canonical measurement admission and release review."],"phase_label":"26 Oct–1 Nov 2009 section","source_quality_note":"Figure 1 caption says fall 2010, whereas abstract/data text specifies 2009 and detailed station occupation 26 Oct-1 Nov 2009. Follow explicit data text and retain discrepancy pending review.","phase_kind":"dated_section","observed_period":{"start":"2009-10-26","end":"2009-11-01"}},{"id":"mediterranean-undercurrent-mean-offshore-span","current_id":"mediterranean-undercurrent","name":"Mediterranean Undercurrent","status":"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical","measurement_type":"published_ensemble_one_sided_span","width_metric":"core_to_offshore_zero_crossing","approximate_width_km":30,"width_range_km":null,"range_interpretation":"No source-supplied width uncertainty. These different metrics and sampling supports do not establish a seasonal 10-30 km range.","geographic_scope":"Southern Portuguese slope, Region 1 of Figures 6-7; not the entire undercurrent.","section_geometry":null,"section_orientation":"Mean zonal velocity versus meridional distance from 36.8 N, binned at 10 km.","layer":"Nonmeddy lower-core RAFOS observations restricted to 950-1250 dbar.","time_convention":"AMUSE ensemble; floats deployed May 1993-March 1994 and tracked up to 11 months. Launch dates are not observation end dates or an annual climatology.","boundary_rule":"Mean velocity maximum to offshore zero crossing only. Inshore fall to zero is not robust in the source; do not interpret as full paired-boundary width or double the value.","source_url":"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2001JC001007","source_citation":"Bower, Serra and Ambar (2002), Structure of the Mediterranean Undercurrent and Mediterranean Water spreading around the southwestern Iberian Peninsula, doi:10.1029/2001JC001007.","source_locator":"Section 2 [7]; Section 3.2 [19]-[21] and Figure 7a.","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-03",