-depth or shelf-break axis diagnosed from the editorial route.","time_convention":"Intermittent coastal drifter profile composite: June–October 2007 and October–November 2008 source context. No exact local-band sampling dates, continuous observation period or seasonal climatology.","boundary_rule":"Author describes the main offshore flow band between 15 and 35 km from coast off Menton–Nice. Span is about 20 km; boundary velocity threshold unspecified. Inshore highly variable flow is not silently included.","source_url":"https://mrea.sincem.unibo.it/images/reports/2011_Poulain_Aspects_of_the_surface_circulation.pdf","source_citation":"Poulain, Gerin, Rixen, Zanasca, Teixeira, Griffa, Molcard, de Marte and Pinardi (2012), Aspects of the surface circulation in the Liguro-Provencal basin and Gulf of Lion as observed by satellite-tracked drifters (2007–2009), Bollettino di Geofisica Teorica ed Applicata 53(2), 261–279, doi:10.4430/bgta0052.","source_locator":"Section 4, pp. 273–274, Fig. 9b and Discussion p. 276: local flow between 15 and 35 km from coast; section 2.1 distinguishes surface drifter types.","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-03","source_evidence_kind":"published_composite_surface_velocity_profile","extraction_method":"Source-reported offshore band positions transcribed; subtract 35 minus 15 km for approximately 20 km local band span. No curve digitized, velocity threshold fitted or map footprint constructed.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"remaining_gates":["Independent source-extraction and segment-assignment review.","Resolve local physical boundaries and wind slip before an occupied footprint or depth-wide width.","Obtain compatible repeated seasonal observations before annual dimension ranges."],"phase_label":"Menton–Nice surface profile composite","phase_kind":"ensemble_profile_band","observed_period":null,"width_metric_label":"reported offshore flow-band span","calendar_months":null,"fixed_layer_bounds_m":null,"bounda