_synthesis_constraint_citing_prior_review","extraction_method":"Inequality transcribed from visually inspected original report prose. No contour digitization, current-axis diagnosis or conversion from the printed coordinate phrase.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"full_width_inference_eligible":false,"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"seasonal_playback_eligible":false,"is_confidence_interval":false,"phase_label":"Reported offshore geographic breadth","phase_kind":"regional_summary","observed_period":null,"calendar_months":null,"fixed_layer_bounds_m":null,"uncertainty_km":null,"source_quality_note":"Government environmental synthesis, not a primary width-section analysis. The report cites Schott and McCreary (2001); identical named-current numeric wording was not found in inspected review text. Printed latitude 60 E mixes coordinate type and hemisphere notation.","remaining_gates":["Recover the underlying velocity-based breadth definition and compatible layer/time support.","Resolve the printed coordinate-type conflict independently of the source inequality.","Review historical narrow-stream versus offshore-current naming without pooling dimensions.","Obtain repeated comparable sections before annual width ranges or map geometry.","Independent scientific and canonical admission."],"original_regional_context":{"width_passage_visually_inspected":true,"source_class":"government_environmental_synthesis","quantity_scope":"offshore_geographic_breadth_not_velocity_core_width","underlying_width_methods_reviewed":false,"reference_scale_is_point_width":false,"notation_is_rigorous_lower_bound":false,"finite_upper_width_extracted":false,"span_is_annual_range":false,"publication_year_is_width_occupation":false,"adjacent_summer_inflow_is_breadth_support":false,"schematic_is_velocity_axis":false,"boundary_coordinates_extracted":false,"coordinate_conflict":{"source_phrase":"latitude 60 E","coordinate_type_agrees_with_hemisphere_notation":false,"coordinate_repaired":false,"used_for_kilometre_conversion":false},"historical_stream_context":{"source_citation":"Andrews (1977), doi:10.1016/0146-6291(77)90517-3","source_access":"Publisher-indexed abstract; original full article remains unreviewed.","reported_width_km":[100,200],"scope":"Narrow cyclonic stream with poleward coastal turn, distinct source convention from broad offshore equatorward flow.","is_range_endpoint_for_this_record":false,"is_seasonal_width_extrema":false},"protocol_file":"plans/west-australian-breadth-constraint-protocol-v1.md","protocol_sha256":"c180fd59c91f61b0b835bf0739cc9a8cc8db0c8a52654832ca46bb466393cdbc","display_caption":"West Australian Current: report describes offshore geographic breadth >1000 km. Not a measured 1000 km point, finite width interval, statistical bound or seasonal range.","display_method_note":"Government synthesis, not a defined velocity section. The latitude 60 E coordinate phrase is inconsistent and is not converted to kilometres. Figure 6.15 is schematic; older 100-200 km cyclonic-stream width is separate naming context. No mapped band or seasonal playback inferred.","audit_file":"research/west-australian-glenn-2008-breadth-scope-audit.json","audit_sha256":"cae64ac5000db69c62c1c8d7bb2b1785c28a7dcd3ddec7cd9277caac27b6851e"},"reported_width_constraint":{"kind":"issuer_reported_greater_than_geographic_breadth","reference_scale_km":1000,"source_notation":">1000 km","is_rigorous_lower_bound":false,"representative_width_km":null,"upper_bound_km":null,"numerical_uncertainty_km":null}},{"id":"humboldt-fuenzalida-2008-core-width","current_id":"peru-humboldt","name":"Peru (Humboldt) Current","status":"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical","measurement_type":"published_regional_summary","width_metric":"author_reported_current_width","approximate_width_km":250,"width_range_km":null,"range_kind":"approximate_regional_point_no_reported_interval","range_interpretation":"One reported description with its own scope. No 250-350 km or 250-800 km range, representative whole-current width, uncertainty, confidence interval or annual extrema inferred.","geographic_scope":"Core described in seasonal surface-geostrophic fields; numerical summer and winter widths are not separately supplied.","section_geometry":null,"section_orientation":"Regional prose description; no exact transverse section endpoints recovered.","layer":"Sea-surface geostrophic flow; hydrographic reference pressure is not a current-width depth slab.","time_convention":"Study surface-geostrophic fields: 1993-2005 excluding July 1997-June 1998. No dated width occupations or numeric seasonal width samples extracted.","boundary_rule":"Author-reported descriptive width; paired velocity edges and reproducible cutoff unresolved.","source_url":"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2007JC004684","source_citation":"Fuenzalida et al. (2008), Satellite altimetry data reveal jet-like dynamics of the Humboldt Current, JGR 113 C07043, doi:10.1029/2007JC004684.","source_locator":"Section 3.3 paragraph 23","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-09","source_evidence_kind":"primary_publisher_html_regional_width_description","extraction_method":"Reported regional width transcribed from primary publisher HTML prose. No PDF, figure or velocity-boundary digitization.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"full_width_inference_eligible":false,"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"seasonal_playback_eligible":false,"is_confidence_interval":false,"phase_label":"Seasonal-climatology core description","phase_kind":"regional_summary","observed_period":null,"calendar_months":null,"fixed_layer_bounds_m":null,"uncertainty_km":null,"source_quality_note":"Primary HTML text inspected; publisher PDF returned HTTP 403 and figures remain uninspected. Core 250 km versus summary jet about 350 km remains unresolved; coarse 800 km mean-flow band is separate support.","remaining_gates":["Recover original figures and raw fields for repro