: 50 km reported width of a mean surface-flow profile. Southern section BB-prime. Two locations do not establish a 40-50 km seasonal range. No mapped width edges.","display_method_note":"Observed radar mean flow, separate from tidal-model predictions. Deployment spans October 2002-October 2004 with site-specific gaps; identical averaging times and weights unresolved. Effective depth, grid spacing and velocity confidence are not a width slab or width error. Seasonal velocity changes do not supply seasonal widths.","display_aria_label":"Pesaro: 50 km reported width of a mean surface-flow profile. Southern section BB-prime. Two locations do not establish a 40-50 km seasonal range. No mapped width edges.","audit_file":"research/western-adriatic-chavanne-2007-mean-width-scope-audit.json","audit_sha256":"61d4d2dfdccb2c51c70d0487ab393a7359bb5b75b8ac5d0d89e7c8adf12ee9fa","audit_pointer":"/measurements/1"}},{"id":"jutland-skov-2019-coastal-water-mass-breadth","current_id":"jutland","name":"Jutland Current","status":"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical","measurement_type":"published_regional_summary","width_metric":"author_reported_current_width","approximate_width_km":null,"width_range_km":[10,20],"range_kind":"reported_typical_regional_width_span","range_interpretation":"Report describes a 10-20 km surface-water-mass breadth in a regional geographic synthesis. Not paired velocity boundaries, a confidence interval, annual extrema or a whole-current width.","geographic_scope":"Surface water mass along the west Jutland coast from Henne Strand north of Horns Rev to Skagen; Wadden Sea offshore traceability and habitat zones have separate support.","section_geometry":null,"section_orientation":"Reported coastal water-mass breadth; no transverse velocity section or paired geographic edges extracted.","layer":"Surface water mass; fixed numerical depth bounds not supplied for this breadth.","time_convention":"Undated regional synthesis in a report approved September 2019. December 2018 modeled maps and seasonal seabird distributions do not date the width statement.","boundary_rule":"Report-provided water-mass breadth citing Nielsen (1999); salinity threshold, paired edges and underlying width method remain unresolved.","source_url":"https://ens.dk/media/5628/download/","source_citation":"Skov, Mortensen and Tuhuteru (2019), Site selection for offshore wind farms in Danish waters: Investigations of bird distribution and abundance, DHI for Energistyrelsen / Danish Energy Agency, project 11823165, final approved 18 September 2019.","source_locator":"Section 2.3, printed p15 / PDF p27 (10-20 km); PDF p26 preceding oceanographic context; Figure 6 PDF p28; section 3.1.1.1 printed pp23-24 / PDF pp35-36 distinguishes habitat and alternate reach; title/credits PDF pp1,3.","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-09","source_evidence_kind":"government_water_mass_geographic_synthesis_citing_prior_source","extraction_method":"Reported breadth span transcribed from visually inspected original prose. No map digitization, salinity contour diagnosis or velocity-core inference.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"full_width_inference_eligible":false,"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"seasonal_playback_eligible":false,"is_confidence_interval":false,"phase_label":"Coastal surface-water-mass breadth","phase_kind":"regional_summary","observed_period":null,"calendar_months":null,"fixed_layer_bounds_m":null,"uncertainty_km":null,"source_quality_note":"Agency-hosted DHI geographic water-mass synthesis. Nielsen thesis reprint now inspected at selected pages: separate 40, 25 and 20-25 km satellite-image estimates cite Aarup (1994a). Exact DHI 10-20 km phrase not confirmed in the reviewed Nielsen width passage. Original imagery methods and North/South label relations remain unresolved.","remaining_gates":["Recover Nielsen (1999) and the underlying water-mass boundary definition.","Resolve North/South Jutland label relations independently of th