ned to the band breadth.","time_convention":"Historical report synthesis using surveys and earlier sections; not a dated repeated-width series or annual climatology.","boundary_rule":"Author-reported approximate breadth of the band occupied by a meandering front and associated eddies; not boundaries of one jet.","source_url":"https://ntrs.nasa.gov/api/citations/19800022345/downloads/19800022345.pdf","source_citation":"Nilsson, Andrews, Lawrence, Ball and Latham (1980), Heat Capacity Mapping Mission Project HCM-051: Progress Report to 30 April 1980, RAN Research Laboratory Internal Technical Memorandum 3/80; NASA NTRS 19800022345.","source_locator":"Original PDF p27 / printed p23, section 3.9; p26 / printed p22 provides separate maximum-scale context.","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-09","source_evidence_kind":"original_technical_report_regional_synthesis","extraction_method":"Factual numerical prose extraction from visually inspected original report; no map or boundary digitization.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"full_width_inference_eligible":false,"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"seasonal_playback_eligible":false,"is_confidence_interval":false,"phase_label":"Meander and eddy occupied band","phase_kind":"regional_summary","observed_period":null,"calendar_months":null,"fixed_layer_bounds_m":null,"uncertainty_km":null,"source_quality_note":"Microfiche reproduction of an interim technical report. Width passage visually verified. No individual jet width, exact boundary criterion or dated width sequence established.","remaining_gates":["Obtain paired observed edges and a declared band/jet definition, layer and averaging rule.","Acquire comparable repeated observations before annual or seasonal margins.","Independent scientific admission."],"original_regional_context":{"description_kind":"tasman_meander_occupied_band","width_passage_visually_inspected":true,"underlying_width_methods_reviewed":true,"full_study_reproduced":false,"tempor