es or the averaging period.","boundary_rule":"Provider-reported width; source does not specify paired edge coordinates or a velocity cutoff. Mean GV 0.2 m/s is not a boundary threshold.","source_url":"https://apps.socib.es/satellite-imagery/RegionalEstimates_satellite-imagery.pdf","source_citation":"Juza, M. (2021), Regional estimates in the application SOCIB Satellite imagery: western Mediterranean Sea and sub-regions, SOCIB. Reviewed document version 13 November 2023.","source_locator":"Section 4 Balearic Sea, PDF/printed page 5, acronym BC and regional-estimates BC row; introduction page 3, license page 2, data credits page 7.","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-14","source_evidence_kind":"published_original_regional_background_synthesis","extraction_method":"Transcribed numerical endpoints from the visually inspected provider table. No field reproduction or width-edge digitization.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"full_width_inference_eligible":false,"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"seasonal_playback_eligible":false,"is_confidence_interval":false,"phase_label":"SOCIB northern-shelf regional synthesis (version 13 November 2023)","phase_kind":"regional_summary","observed_period":null,"calendar_months":null,"fixed_layer_bounds_m":null,"uncertainty_km":null,"source_quality_note":"Provider original reviewed. Exact averaging period, product edition, grid and paired velocity-boundary method remain unspecified. Qualitative autumn maximum is not a numeric seasonal width assignment.","remaining_gates":["Recover row-specific underlying width calculation, source product and paired boundaries.","Recover compatible dated and layer-specific sections before annual or monthly physical widths.","Independent scientific admission."],"original_regional_context":{"description_kind":"provider_regional_width_range","full_original_inspected":false,"source_access":"Relevant original pages read and table visually inspected; not all cited papers or underlyin