ribed 5 S origin to a nominal 7 N retroflection approach. Alternative terminal conventions stop at 5 or 9 N. Excludes upstream North Brazil Undercurrent, offshore retroflected return branch, NECC/EUC continuations, Guiana continuation and detached ring tracks or perimeters. No whole circulation-system length asserted.","route_extent_kind":"North Brazil surface branch","approximate_reference_path_km":2200,"scenario_range_km":[1800,2500],"scenario_count":81,"source_url":"https://os.copernicus.org/articles/19/251/2023/os-19-251-2023.html","source_locator":"Section 1: surface origin near 5 S, NBUC surfacing near 5-6 S, retroflection region 5-9 N / 45-50 W and named Guyana continuation north of 10 N.","supporting_sources":[{"url":"https://www.aoml.noaa.gov/phod/altimetry/cvar/nbc/","citation":"NOAA/AOML, North Brazil Current overview.","locator":"Overview: northeast Brazil boundary current and retroflection between 4 and 10 N; separate northwestward rings.","role":"Broader endpoint variability context; rings are not added to route length."}],"candidate_file":"research/north-brazil-reference-path-candidate.json","candidate_sha256":"250d6b1f2c4a497dcf6461ef545536b176f01b677eb5f85acdc008cb60706257","generator_sha256":"1362693ec7075e014d065691923248db455a5c3cd78c9a94880b3b472594d240","figure":"figures/north-brazil-reference-path-candidate.svg","nominal_atlas_state_crossings":["GUIA","WTRA"],"recommended_nasa_tile_id":"level2_B_4","remaining_gates":["Scientific review of naming limits, layer and regional gate conventions.","Verify bathymetric and velocity correspondence; coarse land clearance does not establish a current axis.","Canonical admission and publication review; retain regional scope and editorial provenance."],"parent_current_id":null,"parent_scope_note":null,"ordering_sensitivity":{"overlapping_candidate_ids":["leeuwin-reference-path-candidate","caribbean-reference-path-candidate","east-greenland-reference-path-candidate","benguela-reference-path-candidate","black