-break WGC distinct from coastal WGCC. Section 3.1: bifurcation near Fylla Bank into westward major branch and narrower northward branch to Davis Strait/Baffin Bay; northward mean route near 500 m isobath.","supporting_sources":[],"candidate_file":"research/west-greenland-reference-path-candidate.json","candidate_sha256":"5b6ab40d9ffb94513da97e8216fda6f57516f4c7c2f88c4eae9af7351a8e1b59","generator_sha256":"1362693ec7075e014d065691923248db455a5c3cd78c9a94880b3b472594d240","figure":"figures/west-greenland-reference-path-candidate.svg","nominal_atlas_state_crossings":["NWCS","SARC"],"recommended_nasa_tile_id":"level2_B_1","remaining_gates":["Scientific review of regional naming extent, branch exclusions and endpoint conventions.","Compare offshore editorial vertices with reproducible bathymetry and suitable layer-specific current geometry.","Canonical admission and publication review; no uniform full-system length inferred."],"parent_current_id":null,"parent_scope_note":null,"ordering_sensitivity":{"overlapping_candidate_ids":["somali-winter-reference-path-candidate","alaska-reference-path-candidate","kuroshio-extension-reference-path-candidate","portugal-reference-path-candidate","davidson-winter-reference-path-candidate","tsushima-coastal-reference-path-candidate","guinea-reference-path-candidate","irminger-reference-path-candidate","mindanao-reference-path-candidate","oyashio-reference-path-candidate","algerian-reference-path-candidate","south-australian-reference-path-candidate","west-spitsbergen-reference-path-candidate","zeehan-reference-path-candidate"],"envelope_position_bounds":[18,32],"interpretation":"Conservative positions within retained rounded route envelopes, treating choices independently; touching envelopes overlap. Not a statistical rank interval or a uniform whole-current comparison."}},{"id":"mindanao-reference-path-candidate","current_id":"mindanao-current","name":"Mindanao Current","status":"editorial_reference_path_candidate_not_scientifically_r