; whole-current and annual dimensions remain unresolved.","source_url":"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2019JC015483","source_locator":"Sections 2.1-2.2: drifter support, 1993-2018 selection, fitted seasonal fields and December-March winter. Section 3 seasonal discussion after Figures 5-6: eastward SECC reaches about 90 E before recirculating into SEC; Figure 13 caption.","observed_period":null,"related_current_ids":["indian-south-equatorial-undercurrent"],"supporting_sources":[{"label":"Section frequency and phase classification: Huang et al. (2023)","url":"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2022JC019147","locator":"Sections 2.1 and 3.1, Figure 2 caption","access":"Relevant full-text sections inspected; no current edge or width geometry extracted."}]}],"evidence_links":[{"label":"Compare twelve surrounding Indian Ocean source-vector maps","url":"../figures/indian-secc-oscar-2d-source.svg"},{"label":"Query surrounding Indian Ocean monthly fields and paired support","url":"query.html?source-q=%7B%22document%22%3A%22research%2Findian-secc-oscar-2d-monthly-source-fields.json%22%2C%22pointer%22%3A%22%2Fmonths%22%2C%22limit%22%3A1%2C%22offset%22%3A0%7D#source-query-title"},{"label":"Query monthly source coverage and component ranges","url":"query.html?source-q=%7B%22document%22%3A%22research%2Findian-secc-oscar-2d-monthly-source-fields.json%22%2C%22pointer%22%3A%22%2Fmonthly_summary%22%2C%22limit%22%3A12%2C%22offset%22%3A0%7D#source-query-title"},{"label":"Download retained source vectors and metadata (ZIP)","url":"../research/source-data/oscar-indian-secc-2d-2013/source-responses.zip"},{"label":"Inspect connected eastward bands and section spans","url":"../figures/indian-secc-positive-band-connectivity.svg"},{"label":"Query monthly band connectivity and unresolved current geometry","url":"query.html?source-q=%7B%22document%22%3A%22research%2Findian-secc-positive-band-connectivity.json%22%2C%22pointer%22%3A%22%2Fmonthly_summ